# kloc.toml schema
#
# `xtask kloc-check` measures every crate (tokei, production Rust only) and prints the size table. The
# only gated row is the kernel envelope, keyed by the crate name `maos-kernel-core` (matching Cargo.toml
# package.name); the value is an integer line-of-code ceiling. A config carrying any other numeric row, or the
# retired `_aggregate_alarm` / `_aggregate_hardfail`, is refused (operator decision 11, lean-gates WP-23).
# Special keys prefixed with '_' are meta-configuration.
#
# Example:
#   maos-kernel-core = 24000
